00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:07.000
Now I noticed something very peculiar about Twitter recently

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.160
Whenever I,

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:11.260
or anyone with a lot of followers would reply to someone on Twitter

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:14.080
it could be a normal, everyday conversation

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:18.100
Whatever it was, the other person would invariably

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.360
FREAK. OUT.

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:23.080
And the freak-outs range wildly from the mildly deranged

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:24.720
