00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:28.080
to a complete disregard for the English language

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:29.400
'LIMICK EFOSUJ'

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.300
And I think it's become like a little game inside the community

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:35.340
To see who can freak out the MOST

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:38.060
when they finally get that reply that they've always wanted.

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:39.100
And I'm not knocking it

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:40.780
I'm not putting it down in any way

00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:44.280
I think it's actually quite hilarious, even though in my mind

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:46.300
I imagine the- the tweet says:

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:47.680
